module

public import LeanPool.HighContrastHomogenization.Provider.Regularity.RoundedUnitCubeDirichletContinuousKDefectResponseDifferenceContraction

/-!
# High-contrast homogenization:
Provider.Regularity.RoundedUnitCubeDirichletContinuousKIterationGeometric

Imported from the Apache-2.0 HighContrastHomogenization development at commit
`7a13dbcd8d6609264a713373f5c69ceeac870472`.
